    "accepted": "Scoped no-model passive startup, independent MCP availability and explicit installation validation. Full app/product acceptance remains open."
  },
  "changes": [
    "Default startup prepares the installed native capability without activating a local model worker; the existing runtime planner activates on its first needed proposal.",
    "Explicit setup still loads the native runtime before recording installation activation success. Passive preparation does not write that record.",
    "A failed native preparation preserves a working helper and deferred vision, reports a waiting setup request as failed, and cannot loop into downloads.",
    "Actual-model browser harnesses now use the same prepare path while keeping explicit installation validation available."
  ],
